==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sagat (Enemy)|Sagat]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

